sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as ODH Platform Operator
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Module as Module Operator<br/>8081/TCP Health
    participant OSApi as OpenShift APIServer CR
    participant Operand as MCP Lifecycle Operator<br/>9443/TCP Webhook
    participant Migrator as kube-storage-version-migrator

    Note over Platform,Migrator: Flow 1: MCPLifecycleOperator Reconciliation

    Platform->>K8s: Create/Update MCPLifecycleOperator CR<br/>(name=default, cluster-scoped)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>Module: Watch notification<br/>(MCPLifecycleOperator)

    Module->>K8s: Read MCPLifecycleOperator CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>Module: CR spec + status

    Module->>K8s: Read OpenShift APIServer TLS profile<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>Module: TLS profile (Intermediate default)

    Note over Module: Render manifests:<br/>label injection, namespace rewrite,<br/>image replacement, TLS env injection,<br/>network policy posture (restricted)

    Module->>K8s: SSA Apply operand resources<br/>(Deployment, Services, RBAC,<br/>CRDs, NetworkPolicy, cert-manager CRs)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>Module: Applied

    Module->>K8s: Garbage collect stale resources<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount

    Module->>K8s: Check operand Deployment readiness<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>Module: Deployment status

    Module->>K8s: Dynamic LIST MCPServers at v1beta1<br/>(conversion health check)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8s->>Operand: Conversion webhook<br/>(/convert, v1alpha1 → v1beta1)
    Operand-->>K8s: Converted MCPServer objects
    K8s-->>Module: MCPServer list (validates convertibility)

    Note over Module: Set MCPServerConversionVerified=True<br/>(durable condition, gates upgrade)

    Module->>K8s: Patch MCPLifecycleOperator status<br/>(status.distribution, status.releases)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount

    Platform->>K8s: Read status.releases<br/>(tracks upgrade completion)

    Note over Platform,Migrator: Flow 2: Storage Version Migration

    Module->>K8s: Discovery: check migration.k8s.io API<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>Module: API available

    Module->>K8s: Create StorageVersionMigration CR<br/>(for mcpservers.mcp.x-k8s.io)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount

    Migrator->>K8s: Re-encode MCPServer objects to v1beta1<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount

    Module->>K8s: Observe migration status.conditions<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>Module: Migration status

    Note over Module: Self-heal failed migrations<br/>(bounded retry: 5 attempts)<br/>MCPServerStorageMigrated condition<br/>(excluded from Ready aggregation)
